<div>
    <h3>关于第三届 “中国电子杯” 高校 ICT 产教融合创新大赛西电校赛报名的通知</h3>
   <div class="time"><span>发布时间：</span>2026-09-17 11:36:31<span>来源：</span>
    <span> 点击：</span><script>_showDynClicks("wbnews", 1482657449, 35712)</script></div>

    
    <div id="vsb_content"><div class="v_news_content">
<section data-page-node-id="s1oSfBLEhPInS6RwA6xId7" data-dm-ref="11" style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif; white-space: normal; background: rgb(244, 247, 251); border-radius: 6px; padding: 14px 16px; margin: 0px 0px 8px;"><p data-page-node-id="4ZWWqofFALdLd2MvHhtnFi" data-dm-ref="12" style="font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); line-height: 1.9; margin: 0px;">本届大赛由<strong data-page-node-id="JMw14DmrKGwNszAz8ZlGyC" data-dm-ref="13" style="color: rgb(27, 75, 143);">"四邮四电"八所高校</strong>主办，<strong data-page-node-id="FTlMiPoSaAXPDmERYrRcwF" data-dm-ref="14" style="color: rgb(27, 75, 143);">中国电子信息产业集团有限公司</strong>联合主办，华大半导体、华大九天、飞腾公司、中国长城、中国软件、麒麟软件、中电金信、奇安信、中国电子云等企业带来产业真实命题。</p></section><p data-page-node-id="H3JHhqDdeThTrpvvBP04NT" data-dm-ref="15" style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif; white-space: normal; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); line-height: 1.9; margin: 10px 0px;">参赛团队<strong data-page-node-id="9M5HlQrJ4ZrhgHYzZHczS1" data-dm-ref="16">以 3 人组队</strong>，从<strong data-page-node-id="5ARPJTIDc9JqiQtosS0GXB" data-dm-ref="17">芯片设计与应用、先进计算应用、网信产业应用</strong>三大赛道中选择一道赛题，完成方案设计、系统开发、技术验证和现场答辩。</p><p data-page-node-id="7bjxL12wvNAe9izspo9oG6" data-dm-ref="18" style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif; white-space: normal; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(208, 58, 43); font-weight: bold; line-height: 1.9; margin: 10px 0px 24px;">如果你想把课堂知识用到真实工程场景中，这一次，欢迎来挑战！</p><p><br></p><section data-page-node-id="9UCmEhyKGCFQQjmx4HorXy" data-dm-ref="19" style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif; white-space: normal; margin: 32px 0px 16px; border-left: 4px solid rgb(27, 75, 143); padding-left: 10px;"><span data-page-node-id="A698QgYXoTrVMAtX8ssnB8" data-dm-ref="20" style="font-size: 14px; color: rgb(27, 75, 143); font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 1px;">01</span><p data-page-node-id="RWlJhi08z54q6tS2tax9x8" data-dm-ref="21" style="margin: 2px 0px 0px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(34, 34, 34);">为什么值得参加？</p></section><section data-page-node-id="9N4aRYJiQWk4rlWTfOy7Td" data-dm-ref="22" style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif; white-space: normal; margin: 0px 0px 6px;"><p data-page-node-id="CGv5Fp2urKI4EgvFMF2vNw" data-dm-ref="23" style="font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); line-height: 1.9; margin: 0px 0px 10px;"><strong data-page-node-id="UpnIlRg5sABwotE3xCZl9y" data-dm-ref="24" style="color: rgb(27, 75, 143);">■ 企业真实命题</strong><br data-page-node-id="ctfV1gF8B7H7sEBCkiYhv2" data-dm-ref="25">题目来自芯片、基础软件、人工智能、数据平台和网络安全等产业场景。</p><p data-page-node-id="gJ2EMoi4cPjzXxfHLWNnx7" data-dm-ref="26" style="font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); line-height: 1.9; margin: 0px 0px 10px;"><strong data-page-node-id="JjgTnD099KFf8Cj8Teg4dF" data-dm-ref="27" style="color: rgb(27, 75, 143);">■ 专家参与评审</strong><br data-page-node-id="tjuc7FurMIVhhSfRV8yA0w" data-dm-ref="28">命题企业和高校专家共同参与评价，帮助参赛同学了解工程实践中的真实要求。</p><p data-page-node-id="6FWxSq0hr1dM3OTj1nKmVL" data-dm-ref="29" style="font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); line-height: 1.9; margin: 0px 0px 10px;"><strong data-page-node-id="jO9R656oe7AFBAXOxpRYQu" data-dm-ref="30" style="color: rgb(27, 75, 143);">■ 积累项目成果</strong><br data-page-node-id="0vEV2heKT3W1sAoa3YfzZ9" data-dm-ref="31">从需求分析、方案设计到开发验证和现场路演，完整经历一次项目推进过程。</p><p data-page-node-id="pnU7DYJZK8GQa2VNfnNIkv" data-dm-ref="32" style="font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); line-height: 1.9; margin: 0px;"><strong data-page-node-id="lH1YOkZONKflGplUYykFga" data-dm-ref="33" style="color: rgb(27, 75, 143);">■ 奖金与发展机会</strong><br data-page-node-id="p3mSuuJu3Ey30yxFGU1gEQ" data-dm-ref="34">学生团队<strong data-page-node-id="nObxMqCkI6T6vn85fyypn1" data-dm-ref="35">奖金丰厚</strong>，综合评估排名前 10<strong data-page-node-id="g4VvkMjq6bwf1r1huSTJqj" data-dm-ref="36" style="color: rgb(208, 58, 43);">% 的</strong>选手可获得<strong data-page-node-id="LVYeUmMW0bJiEWNyuL13t1" data-dm-ref="37" style="color: rgb(208, 58, 43);">中国电子招聘和实习直通卡</strong>。</p></section><section data-page-node-id="Pb4WuWKgwGYExn2lza1vEr" data-dm-ref="38" style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif; white-space: normal; margin: 32px 0px 16px; border-left: 4px solid rgb(27, 75, 143); padding-left: 10px;"><span data-page-node-id="MHlOriLHtuTlzLBdfHbcKv" data-dm-ref="39" style="font-size: 14px; color: rgb(27, 75, 143); font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 1px;">02</span><p data-page-node-id="ayUEQVbqSYqJGygwsbDfjR" data-dm-ref="40" style="margin: 2px 0px 0px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(34, 34, 34);">三大赛道、九道企业命题</p></section><section data-page-node-id="g2DFD4V3luHYCJ9RsCoHDs" data-dm-ref="41" style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif; white-space: normal; background: rgb(244, 247, 251); border-radius: 6px; padding: 14px 16px; margin: 0px 0px 12px;"><p data-page-node-id="HHZhCBrblylG7xD4pro3PO" data-dm-ref="42" style="font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(27, 75, 143); margin: 0px 0px 10px;">赛道一 · 芯片设计与应用</p><p data-page-node-id="NvT6EOnbcyNC5iaa7Hb0ey" data-dm-ref="43" style="font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); line-height: 1.9; margin: 0px 0px 8px;"><strong data-page-node-id="0lN7Woaeo4eHjYL5FOA8pK" data-dm-ref="44">赛题一：高压高精度电流传感放大器芯片设计</strong><br data-page-node-id="yP9YVGGwyq1q9vsZH4Pc5y" data-dm-ref="45"><span data-page-node-id="2lw5Ig4UvWA6RNefbROfSf" data-dm-ref="46" style="color: rgb(136, 136, 136); font-size: 13px;">命题单位：上海贝岭股份有限公司</span></p><p data-page-node-id="LMFcejCjUrENvb9ozpRD5W" data-dm-ref="47" style="font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); line-height: 1.9; margin: 0px 0px 8px;"><strong data-page-node-id="k3brZoTXxv5g0Gbtgo8yzc" data-dm-ref="48">赛题二：模拟电路 AI 智能化设计</strong><br data-page-node-id="5FiOtzfzOp0sGZYQMGbEBS" data-dm-ref="49"><span data-page-node-id="27kfKaw0UGZpKJUfNgyIM4" data-dm-ref="50" style="color: rgb(136, 136, 136); font-size: 13px;">命题单位：北京华大九天科技股份有限公司</span></p><p data-page-node-id="stGMUFNoCcbHMmKfgm4DVY" data-dm-ref="51" style="font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); line-height: 1.9; margin: 0px;"><strong data-page-node-id="2wAhwHSunIKh71EK5zjgfv" data-dm-ref="52">赛题三：带高阶 FIR 数字滤波器的 SoC 处理器设计</strong><br data-page-node-id="CPMEwElNN0jrnglfyiXwSN" data-dm-ref="53"><span data-page-node-id="BRt0IwPXkrexpig0iwDzC9" data-dm-ref="54" style="color: rgb(136, 136, 136); font-size: 13px;">命题单位：飞腾信息技术有限公司</span></p></section><section data-page-node-id="hJkz2FXehWksIwWBqKmW4I" data-dm-ref="55" style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif; white-space: normal; background: rgb(244, 247, 251); border-radius: 6px; padding: 14px 16px; margin: 0px 0px 12px;"><p data-page-node-id="p73h3zyKa6K4ANLnUObQrE" data-dm-ref="56" style="font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(27, 75, 143); margin: 0px 0px 10px;">赛道二 · 先进计算应用</p><p data-page-node-id="XpYpjeJJkizAJrCoKoPzCz" data-dm-ref="57" style="font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); line-height: 1.9; margin: 0px 0px 8px;"><strong data-page-node-id="CHHXAtER6dT3bZzmgEwySo" data-dm-ref="58">赛题四：国产服务器性能调优</strong><br data-page-node-id="a9pBnhZT2gL08g3IPE58Aa" data-dm-ref="59"><span data-page-node-id="8GPLXreyu2GuJ1vR3SHO2S" data-dm-ref="60" style="color: rgb(136, 136, 136); font-size: 13px;">命题单位：中国长城科技集团股份有限公司</span></p><p data-page-node-id="6CuLcSKOjHdc7a7KEZ