x;"><strong data-page-node-id="6rdtAy31SElQh5OaaDsxOc" data-dm-ref="76">赛题八：多模态数据驱动的可解释精准问数问答智能体</strong><br data-page-node-id="22SEpFSYEsl6RWWCsAqfyj" data-dm-ref="77"><span data-page-node-id="HxX1c938NP2uQzPy06g7P3" data-dm-ref="78" style="color: rgb(136, 136, 136); font-size: 13px;">命题单位：中电云计算技术有限公司</span></p><p data-page-node-id="p11XwGQlAQf42VBzGTrDwF" data-dm-ref="79" style="font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); line-height: 1.9; margin: 0px;"><strong data-page-node-id="fYlEoqlQTVFRj2VlYRFnGU" data-dm-ref="80">赛题九：智能体驱动的 AI 安全知识情报系统设计与实现</strong><br data-page-node-id="1SHWuW7lgASnZU0EuY633Y" data-dm-ref="81"><span data-page-node-id="SDAkRaVsONhEhr5bErDx7i" data-dm-ref="82" style="color: rgb(136, 136, 136); font-size: 13px;">命题单位：奇安信科技集团股份有限公司</span></p></section><section data-page-node-id="MkjPsdbx89xQDx3VhIuOHX" data-dm-ref="83" style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif; white-space: normal; margin: 32px 0px 16px; border-left: 4px solid rgb(27, 75, 143); padding-left: 10px;"><span data-page-node-id="s6lpGsB3Fm4VtgvhJ0p2Rb" data-dm-ref="84" style="font-size: 14px; color: rgb(27, 75, 143); font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 1px;">03</span><p data-page-node-id="qEB1YKNqbsA3SdZ3DcCdFi" data-dm-ref="85" style="margin: 2px 0px 0px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(34, 34, 34);">参赛对象与赛程安排</p></section><section data-page-node-id="HJC0VxEFnze6kcarhiYwFP" data-dm-ref="86" style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif; white-space: normal; margin: 0px 0px 6px;"><p data-page-node-id="wG6RUSuEs4qtUIcUb5sMiZ" data-dm-ref="87" style="font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); line-height: 1.9; margin: 0px 0px 10px;"><strong data-page-node-id="mEroTDnfoVAZloWUJpZkHA" data-dm-ref="88" style="color: rgb(27, 75, 143);">参赛对象</strong><br data-page-node-id="KQjP5FCfySxpqFtaksPkyf" data-dm-ref="89">"四邮四电"高校全日制在校<strong data-page-node-id="6A7md75tq5Hbid7AvOZo9N" data-dm-ref="90">本科生、研究生</strong>。</p><p data-page-node-id="RZcJlYC4lWDV8czU9O73Me" data-dm-ref="91" style="font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); line-height: 1.9; margin: 0px 0px 16px;"><strong data-page-node-id="0S2GPyUYdy6qKtiL5vY4YD" data-dm-ref="92" style="color: rgb(27, 75, 143);">组队要求</strong><br data-page-node-id="l7Hz5jLAw3wAxJHmfTO6uY" data-dm-ref="93">每队由 3<strong data-page-node-id="s0gZBLviPgyCRCSZRhbdFJ" data-dm-ref="94" style="color: rgb(208, 58, 43);"> 名</strong>学生组成，每队指导教师<strong data-page-node-id="0Uxr6seqcF3MeeET1lWC7K" data-dm-ref="95">不超过 2 人</strong>，鼓励跨学校、跨专业组队。</p></section><section data-page-node-id="kcjfOFjZ6foqvw1TukMMhr" data-dm-ref="96" style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif; white-space: normal; margin: 0px 0px 16px;"><p data-page-node-id="tT6WRiWtbFqoZpVBHaeddS" data-dm-ref="97" style="font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); line-height: 1.9; margin: 0px 0px 10px;"><strong data-page-node-id="uQcNuxJYQyomloEGbl6KHW" data-dm-ref="98" style="color: rgb(27, 75, 143);">1. 报名截止</strong><br data-page-node-id="M79u4ucvSBBBRkcDEhIBoP" data-dm-ref="99">2026 年<strong data-page-node-id="dFEKcFehATTO9nNzDLsDPa" data-dm-ref="100" style="color: rgb(208, 58, 43);">9月 30日 24:00</strong></p><p data-page-node-id="sBPH8oVjB6eLF8gxVWEiNg" data-dm-ref="101" style="font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); line-height: 1.9; margin: 0px 0px 10px;"><strong data-page-node-id="LCtHivH2xzYAKnaROeJ512" data-dm-ref="102" style="color: rgb(27, 75, 143);">2. 校内初赛</strong><br data-page-node-id="HG3Sxql45H3zcDG32Lw20p" data-dm-ref="103">2026 年 <strong data-page-node-id="ejtwCJDGNCQknwj3E3gATf" data-dm-ref="104">10 月 初</strong></p><p data-page-node-id="ZbsV3XCFMSCiwe5hX8Iiyx" data-dm-ref="105" style="font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); line-height: 1.9; margin: 0px 0px 10px;"><strong data-page-node-id="umHRVvTuTzRSxoF4V5iBoL" data-dm-ref="106" style="color: rgb(27, 75, 143);">3. 报送晋级名单</strong><br data-page-node-id="HZwCzJofK9v0k5yIN2vNcN" data-dm-ref="107">2026 年 <strong data-page-node-id="spsh1KUGQh5aGxq8le1NsB" data-dm-ref="108">10 月 底</strong><br data-page-node-id="NNpBJetdNZ0NDB7e1khDe6" data-dm-ref="109">每校可推荐 9 支队伍，每道赛题可推荐 1 支队伍。</p><p data-page-node-id="oham5pTmRIgBnKARu1sjND" data-dm-ref="110" style="font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); line-height: 1.9; margin: 0px 0px 10px;"><strong data-page-node-id="ef6ju5sHxBzbIeBMTt1kC5" data-dm-ref="111" style="color: rgb(27, 75, 143);">4. 提交决赛材料</strong><br data-page-node-id="uOMQ5qGd4rSjXSU4zU5gXZ" data-dm-ref="112">2026 年 <strong data-page-node-id="TJncqvLDjglmEAU2iDXMhH" data-dm-ref="113">11 月 20 日前</strong></p><p data-page-node-id="FpSdcY5zxCsknIvTa1sGzO" data-dm-ref="114" style="font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); line-height: 1.9; margin: 0px 0px 16px;"><strong data-page-node-id="PYWh792cKhNACDUD1qj0lU" data-dm-ref="115" style="color: rgb(27, 75, 143);">5. 现场决赛</strong><br data-page-node-id="vhMzsyCGELg8YNNne8Gaia" data-dm-ref="116">2026 年 <strong data-page-node-id="GDCuQvfJco1U7kRtdwE9M5" data-dm-ref="117">12 月 3 日</strong><br data-page-node-id="p0qsCyhSi5mFXnKPVHngM0" data-dm-ref="118">地点：南京邮电大学</p></section><section data-page-node-id="n1sO6r7WOEAgEIqaQfpZ0k" data-dm-ref="119" style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif; white-space: normal; background: rgb(253, 246, 236); border-radius: 6px; padding: 14px 16px; margin: 0px 0px 8px;"><p data-page-node-id="7TLifNm9FQq1acBUSFX3Ag" data-dm-ref="120" style="font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); line-height: 1.9; margin: 0px 0px 8px;"><strong data-page-node-id="DmZAaHGhpJsewdjEZomuqq" data-dm-ref="121" style="color: rgb(178, 106, 0);">晋级机制</strong><br data-page-node-id="vr1qisZGS7IsUgM0DBZ9vA" data-dm-ref="122">各命题企业还可从初赛作品质量优秀但未晋级的队伍中自主推荐 2 支队伍直通决赛，推荐名单须经组委会审核确认。</p><p data-page-node-id="xwav8q077F1cFFjWIwzXQm" data-dm-ref="123" style="font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); line-height: 1.9; margin: 0px;"><strong data-page-node-id="HgZVCxAHEEuBboJPAeMD3Z" data-dm-ref="124" style="color: rgb(178, 106, 0);">决赛形式与排名规则</strong><br data-page-node-id="pc98vgrAnpiL6HMySdmo4o" data-dm-ref="125">现场决赛采用路演形式；各赛道第一名进入冠亚季军争夺赛。</p></section><section data-page-node-id="vIcQgsbMh3j7m2PVIeqoiF" data-dm-ref="126" style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif; white-space: normal; margin: 32px 0px 16px; border-left: 4px solid rgb(27, 75, 143); padding-left: 10px;"><span data-page-node-id="DGlTBijpIDkYizBHkZMgVl" data-dm-ref="127" style="font-size: 14px; color: rgb(27, 75, 143); font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 1px;">04</span><p data-page-node-id="aXJtEpVMKpuzJNlCRSRR2N" data-dm-ref="128" style="margin: 2px 0px 0px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(34, 34, 34);">奖励与发展机会</p></section><p><br></p><p data-page-node-id="xQDaOQ6KTymF3aanHoXlLv" data-dm-ref="129" style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif; white-space: normal; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); line-height: 1.9; margin: 0px 0px 12px;">本届大赛鼓励大家积极报名，<strong data-page-node-id="yttNk6eeN2CRz8pdj1uQvO" data-dm-ref="130" style="color: rgb(208, 58, 43);">奖金丰厚！</strong></p><p><br></p><section data-page-node-id="ezI0MwWRNJu6DTi2L7fivb" data-dm-ref="131" style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif; white-space: normal; background: rgb(244, 247, 251); border-radius: 6px; padding: 14px 16px; margin: 0px 0px 12px;"><p data-page-node-id="bxmz1SuUaNhl4WulJo48kF" data-dm-ref="132" style="font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(27, 75, 143); margin: 0px 0px 10px;">奖金明细</p><p data-page-node-id="GfFg7fPKh8sHqz9aV7BCkx" data-dm-ref="133" style="font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); line-height: 1.9; margin: 0px 0px 6px;">● 冠军：1 项，<strong data-page-node-id="cUbHl9e1UEmvs9ci21Tc3n" data-dm-ref="134" style="color: rgb(208, 58, 43);">40,000 元</strong></p><p data-page-node-id="ScLbnBMHe6zHIBa2cFJrZB" data-dm-ref="135" style="font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); line-height: 1.9; margin: 0px 0px 6px;">● 亚军：1 项，<strong data-page-node-id="pawv5N5Qn75k3oTh5aqlYE" data-dm-ref="136" style="color: rgb(208, 58, 43);">20,000 元</strong></p><p data-page-node-id="f7Bk0zbE5hBeNBNa5amn98" data-dm-ref="137" style="font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); line-height: 1.9; margin: 0px 0px 6px;">● 季军：1 项，<strong data-page-node-id="oDYBGwdM32tBnDR7N2J4Qk" data-dm-ref="138" style="color: rgb(208, 58, 43);">15,000 元</strong></p><p data-page-node-id="ydtmlovnfJ9pBvvcmKISme" data-dm-ref="139" style="font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); line-height: 1.9; margin: 0px 0px 6px;">● 一等奖：6 项，<strong data-page-node-id="2Idy4NVswfWjindnDKffwG" data-dm-ref="140">8,000 元/项</strong></p><p data-page-node-id="oFbx0kNB0bpFmNXa3qjNVx" data-dm-ref="141" style="font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); line-height: 1.9; margin: 0px 0px 6px;">● 二等奖：9 项，<strong data-page-node-id="aPBXLdlcQabJBfNECYSvAw" data-dm-ref="142">6,000 元/项</strong></p><p data-page-node-id="BnRPibMkCYtZsZZkOrYKAE" data-dm-ref="143" style="font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); line-height: 1.9; margin: 0px 0px 6px;">● 三等奖：18 项，<strong data-page-node-id="DCW2hHzwswzPQoWRMkQMey" data-dm-ref="144">4,000 元/项</strong></p><p data-page-node-id="mSd5Wxd3zp6nKL6PVsug2W" data-dm-ref="145" style="font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); line-height: 1.9; margin: 0px;">● 优秀奖：54 项，<strong data-page-node-id="sAPStKalZAPRZ6U5ZfeFwI" data-dm-ref="146">2,000 元/项</strong></p></section><section data-page-node-id="fV7te9N6ypUJO3nJroJiZO" data-dm-ref="147" style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif; white-space: normal; margin: 0px;"><p data-page-node-id="EHbBZGjqgmnhipPmKELKQ3" data-dm-ref="148" style="font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); line-height: 1.9; margin: 0px 0px 10px;"><strong data-page-node-id="HyA2jRZhOkk3MbaoHf6lx0" data-dm-ref="149" style="color: rgb(27, 75, 143);">■ 优秀指导教师奖</strong><br data-page-node-id="44RNLyipnqPCPMYKhr8KAB" data-dm-ref="150">晋级决赛项目的第一指导教师可获得 1,500<strong data-page-node-id="rJHC5n0Yee8MBsBETzWVyF" data-dm-ref="151"> 元</strong>。（同一指导教师指导多个团队获奖时，奖金可叠加）</p><p data-page-node-id="EEQu34RNsB4zbPr3dDsxyh" data-dm-ref="152" style="font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); line-height: 1.9; margin: 0px 0px 10px;"><strong data-page-node-id="EblKp936cn8ZE2h0QoHxB8" data-dm-ref="153" style="color: rgb(27, 75, 143);">■ 招聘和实习直通卡</strong><br data-page-node-id="BjFJfNMRaJ0qzbFs3Xz0EY" data-dm-ref="154">综合评估排名前 10<strong data-page-node-id="pGgu0lVTGPh3HZgOiybibO" data-dm-ref="155" style="color: rgb(208, 58, 43);">% 的</strong>选手，可获得中国电子招聘和实习直通卡，免笔试直达技术终面，或获得定制化实习机会。</p><p data-page-node-id="tjD0UdxkSPskzetuTif2uM" data-dm-ref="156" style="font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); line-height: 1.9; margin: 0px;"><strong data-page-node-id="x7ZaxZdojH1l2p4CbOILsF" data-dm-ref="157" style="color: rgb(27, 75, 143);">■ 其他发展机会</strong><br data-page-node-id="lZJeXOvQQOCKAKULyjO1HU" data-dm-ref="158">优秀成果可获得知识产权快速登记、成果孵化和企业内部项目推荐机会。所有决赛选手将建立包含技术栈、比赛表现和专家评语的人才档案，纳入中国电子人才库进行长期跟踪。</p></section><section data-page-node-id="GnMjArQ6bo4YggGXY9vhqY" data-dm-ref="159" style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif; white-space: normal; margin: 32px 0px 16px; border-left: 4px solid rgb(27, 75, 143); padding-left: 10px;"><span data-page-node-id="C0tZgnN7wBd4jhKQ48A7zs" data-dm-ref="160" style="font-size: 14px; color: rgb(27, 75, 143); font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 1px;">05</span><p data-page-node-id="CwzRNYNKzZfA7gcgQUVv1F" data-dm-ref="161" style="margin: 2px 0px 0px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(34, 34, 34);">报名方式</p></section><section data-page-node-id="yrA5K2hbpEhOLEUioAUIlq" data-dm-ref="162" style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif; white-space: normal; background: rgb(244, 247, 251); border-radius: 6px; padding: 14px 16px; margin: 0px 0px 8px;"><p data-page-node-id="YF6CPqZb2mpH7y1At36sS2" data-dm-ref="163" style="font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); line-height: 1.9; margin: 0px 0px 8px;">组建 3<strong data-page-node-id="Z4QuhaDVk6yrGAkLUWHtUa" data-dm-ref="164"> 人团队</strong>，确定团队负责人、指导教师和参赛赛题。填写<strong data-page-node-id="bZJTD8JAV9z4nh7OPk8nAf" data-dm-ref="165">《团队报名表》</strong>和<strong data-page-node-id="rorBsGfgnIvXksWduVKBTi" data-dm-ref="166">《报名汇总表》</strong>。由所在高校统一收集、审核，并发送至指定邮箱。</p><p data-page-node-id="TAWHXvH98sWS2d5Yp4jMco" data-dm-ref="167" style="font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); line-height: 1.9; margin: 0px 0px 8px;"><strong data-page-node-id="ktodpA2Kw6aY0EyBua0ot4" data-dm-ref="168">邮箱：请以本校通知为准。</strong></p><p data-page-node-id="eFhCNSs1vNcpL7lh8cj5lT" data-dm-ref="169" style="font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); line-height: 1.9; margin: 0px;"><strong data-page-node-id="BVfR6FKhSCgosVMm1njo4s" data-dm-ref="170">组委会截止时间：2026 年 9 月 30 日 24:00</strong>（各高校请以本校通知为准）。</p></section><section data-page-node-id="HFncDVglcI0nQ3svx7vuTH" data-dm-ref="171" style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif; white-space: normal; margin: 32px 0px 16px; border-left: 4px solid rgb(27, 75, 143); padding-left: 10px;"><span data-page-node-id="zjwYpOADyIgYPRcWUtrLns" data-dm-ref="172" style="font-size: 14px; color: rgb(27, 75, 143); font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 1px;">06</span><p data-page-node-id="RuQito8nVNe0J7qoT5fiLe" data-dm-ref="173" style="margin: 2px 0px 0px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(34, 34, 34);">参赛规定</p></section><section data-page-node-id="BQGGP75Ke1tFTixCBvPoCA" data-dm-ref="174" style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif; white-space: normal; margin: 0px;"><p data-page-node-id="XCj7k64QTnVOBPaf3uegi7" data-dm-ref="175" style="font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); line-height: 1.9; margin: 0px 0px 10px;"><strong data-page-node-id="hHeZcqzRnsyTw53RlPeDt2" data-dm-ref="176" style="color: rgb(27, 75, 143);">■ 知识产权要求</strong><br data-page-node-id="6OFDyLqvd1nwHJkfeOjAcn" data-dm-ref="177">参赛团队须对提交的应答材料拥有自主知识产权，不得侵犯他人知识产权或物权。</p><p data-page-node-id="CWCKY6ExJtLa8MlzE2zeYh" data-dm-ref="178" style="font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); line-height: 1.9; margin: 0px 0px 10px;"><strong data-page-node-id="Q8jl9HDRqe15ntcgcIFwHm" data-dm-ref="179" style="color: rgb(27, 75, 143);">■ 诚信参赛要求</strong><br data-page-node-id="a0WItYv0k52OVEjWixdD7g" data-dm-ref="180">如有抄袭、盗用他人成果、提供虚假材料等行为，一经发现，将丧失参赛资格、所获奖项等相关权利，并承担相应法律责任。</p><p data-page-node-id="CMveWrb0XgIxHuvRcn9BWq" data-dm-ref="181" style="font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); line-height: 1.9; margin: 0px;"><strong data-page-node-id="9y43WQMe1PBF2RobJkaYAG" data-dm-ref="182" style="color: rgb(27, 75, 143);">■ 资格审查</strong><br data-page-node-id="VmFTPBFMcXQckBEU807HJc" data-dm-ref="183">参赛团队所在学院负责审查参赛团队及项目的真实性和合规性。</p></section><section data-page-node-id="p3CO6cbJHzKb4yXk76wowl" data-dm-ref="184" style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif; white-space: normal; margin: 32px 0px 16px; border-left: 4px solid rgb(27, 75, 143); padding-left: 10px;"><span data-page-node-id="b08oBRHsKDlVhnNuGucpjL" data-dm-ref="185" style="font-size: 14px; color: rgb(27, 75, 143); font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 1px;">07</span><p data-page-node-id="hqEEivKlGkpu4hO36CbHrr" data-dm-ref="186" style="margin: 2px 0px 0px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(34, 34, 34);">现在，该你上场了</p></section><section data-page-node-id="J1sw2u39kSruBRTyYe71gD" data-dm-ref="187" style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif; white-space: normal; text-align: center; margin: 0px 0px 20px;"><p data-page-node-id="BrGX87lpMIKEKOaZyggCrA" data-dm-ref="188" style="font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); line-height: 2.1; margin: 0px;">一张电路图，<br data-page-node-id="toqRYK6RczLWWY40P8fSRq" data-dm-ref="189">可以回应真实的芯片设计需求；<br data-page-node-id="Oi4ozmsDXzv5POlUQvb3HB" data-dm-ref="190">一段代码，<br data-page-node-id="6dS24HsPsinjnJDNbOs3d8" data-dm-ref="191">可以成为一套系统的关键能力；<br data-page-node-id="YVaRaWEzCq5d52zsGiyD6A" data-dm-ref="192">一个 3 人团队，<br data-page-node-id="s6lmFOW0SXWc6N8hy3CX3P" data-dm-ref="193">也可以把不同专业的知识，<br data-page-node-id="eM7U7QiqMCgOjh8CT8lUnd" data-dm-ref="194">汇聚成完整方案。</p><p data-page-node-id="MwG6zKSDBEve8wlGQL2C6T" data-dm-ref="195" style="font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); line-height: 2.1; margin: 14px 0px 0px;">企业真题已经发布，<br data-page-node-id="Lm0tLlbgINiNPkQB4PsRRv" data-dm-ref="196">奖金和发展机会等你来争取。<br data-page-node-id="MAiYm6PCo2jChYUglsZdPP" data-dm-ref="197">现在组队、选择赛题，<br data-page-node-id="QkJ1TqqSEG7lnGgz13P1vL" data-dm-ref="198"><strong data-page-node-id="JOHqWy46rsq2STEVspWGcR" data-dm-ref="199" style="color: rgb(208, 58, 43);">9 月 30 日 24:00 前完成报名，</strong><br data-page-node-id="l9jHqPGOesTW3FmallEhfe" data-dm-ref="200">期待在"中国电子杯"赛场上见到你！</p></section><section data-page-node-id="4Qq1uZBwgfLPe0zIEA3bcq" data-dm-ref="201" style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif; white-space: normal; background: rgb(244, 247, 251); border-radius: 6px; padding: 14px 16px; margin: 0px 0px 12px;"><p data-page-node-id="bzOknBODBFo6UV2HoeglaS" data-dm-ref="202" style="font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); line-height: 1.9; margin: 0px 0px 6px;"><strong data-page-node-id="eLymNdTPmiE71Xj9gb5IqX" data-dm-ref="203" style="color: rgb(27, 75, 143);">联系人：</strong>刘老师</p><p data-page-node-id="CtCgxCXwWBEkRDDOWSYpcu" data-dm-ref="204" style="font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); line-height: 1.9; margin: 0px 0px 6px;"><strong data-page-node-id="gOH7xV61qitMFZOwSmoP0I" data-dm-ref="205" style="color: rgb(27, 75, 143);">联系电话：</strong>029-81892262</p><p data-page-node-id="V4IpK5xaCUzPNsPcFUwN96" data-dm-ref="206" style="font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); line-height: 1.9; margin: 0px 0px 6px;"><strong data-page-node-id="wzFFCSpZLMptCyahXhLDsc" data-dm-ref="207" style="color: rgb(27, 75, 143);">邮箱：</strong>cxcy@xidian.edu.cn</p><p data-page-node-id="bLNaOOZqOqCIaiURtz5Azx" data-dm-ref="208" style="font-size: 14px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); line-height: 1.9; margin: 0px;"><strong data-page-node-id="Ha9DItBsSwypwHl72ViS5F" data-dm-ref="209" style="color: rgb(208, 58, 43);">扫描二维码加入大赛 QQ 群（群号：1125792101），获取后续通知</strong></p></section><section data-page-node-id="5HNuwUa50FZ51pVdWwXhGn" data-dm-ref="210" style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif; white-space: normal; text-align: center; margin: 0px 0px 24px;"><section data-page-node-id="JYwG1v7ITAVQy8WQ0LMVHJ" data-dm-ref="211" style="display: inline-block; width: 150px; height: 150px; border: 1px dashed rgb(204, 204, 204); border-radius: 6px; line-height: 150px; color: rgb(153, 153, 153); font-size: 12px;"><img src="/__local/F/42/A3/222D91FBEA4B2E39B78943DA598_3C2BFC48_B905.png" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/F42A3222D91FBEA4B2E39B78943DA598/3C2BFC48/B905" vheight="" vwidth="" orisrc="/__local/F/42/A3/222D91FBEA4B2E39B78943DA598_3C2BFC48_B905.png" class="img_vsb_content"></section></section><section data-page-node-id="3ZILQFZAKvnGLVGtDr8DR8" data-dm-ref="212" style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, sans-serif; white-space: normal; border-top: 1px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); padding-top: 16px; margin: 0px 0px 8px;"><p data-page-node-id="GNaT5Tntamwm2UDnVgsy7t" data-dm-ref="213" style="font-size: 13px; color: rgb(136, 136, 136); line-height: 1.9; margin: 0px 0px 8px;"><strong data-page-node-id="fteYuzY4TfnXvLaWl5UKTB" data-dm-ref="214" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102);">主办单位</strong><br data-page-node-id="l9CgJYbEWr6EhmbQbvTcx5" data-dm-ref="215">北京邮电大学、电子科技大学、南京邮电大学、西安电子科技大学、重庆邮电大学、杭州电子科技大学、西安邮电大学、桂林电子科技大学</p><p data-page-node-id="4Hkzc6PFVUuwZ2FkVKeCKm" data-dm-ref="216" style="font-size: 13px; color: rgb(136, 136, 136); line-height: 1.9; margin: 0px 0px 8px;"><strong data-page-node-id="MrZm65BC9q00z73FRqBfVS" data-dm-ref="217" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102);">联合主办单位</strong><br data-page-node-id="OJQAId53RAaIhq8rdSQD2E" data-dm-ref="218">中国电子信息产业集团有限公司</p><p data-page-node-id="YD7CMjX69zIkpqZ8yO5QiX" data-dm-ref="219" style="font-size: 13px; color: rgb(136, 136, 136); line-height: 1.9; margin: 0px 0px 8px;"><strong data-page-node-id="OB4k2qJKZ9Azjgf2AULpJh" data-dm-ref="220" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102);">承办单位</strong><br data-page-node-id="JCA3TEp4BpWiZQJrwPa7Yr" data-dm-ref="221">南京邮电大学、南京鼓楼高新技术产业开发区</p><p data-page-node-id="Tdd53LajyHWEXxl5GiE90v" data-dm-ref="222" style="font-size: 13px; color: rgb(136, 136, 136); line-height: 1.9; margin: 0px;"><strong data-page-node-id="sETdklzYttwBm63gF0UG6M" data-dm-ref="223" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102);">协办单位</strong><br data-page-node-id="0NHsFj7d2WftLGzRCFbe5r" data-dm-ref="224">华大半导体、华大九天、飞腾公司、中国长城、中国软件、麒麟软件、中电金信、奇安信、中国电子云</p></section><p><br></p><p><br></p>
